1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Good morning! Tell us, please,
what exactly do you do?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,000
Tell us a bit about your farm:
what types of oils do you produce?

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,500
What crops do you grow yourself,
and where are your fields located?

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,500
My name is Igor Golban,
I am the owner of "Biantti" LLC.

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:22,000
We have 28 hectares of walnuts,
almonds, and sea buckthorn.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
We produce oils, walnuts, seeds,
vinegars, syrups, jams, and dried fruits.

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:34,000
Our range of oils includes
over 45 types of cold-pressed oils.

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Starting from pumpkin, flax, hemp,
milk thistle, walnuts, almonds, hazelnuts.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Our range is very large.
Basically, coconut oil —

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000
we have about 10–15 types of oils
that our competitors do not produce.

11
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Camelina oil, rosehip oil,
amaranth oil, and other types.

12
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,500
We are located in
Băcioi, Străisteni village.

13
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:08,000
That is where our production is,
where our warehouse and business are.

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
What are the main sanitary rules
and standards you follow

15
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,500
to guarantee the quality
and safety of your oil?

16
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:24,500
First of all, we buy all certified seeds,
with invoices and certificates from ANSA.

17
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:30,000
Our production is certified
and all processes are fully traceable.

18
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Starting from reception of raw materials,
processing, filtration, bottling,

19
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:41,000
labeling, delivery — all in accordance
with the HACCP standard.

20
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:47,000
We do everything so that the entire
product is fully monitored

21
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:50,500
and complies with
current legislation.

22
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:56,000
It is known that in Moldova
the climate is becoming unpredictable.

23
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:01,500
Severe droughts or hail strongly affect
the harvest of oilseed crops.

24
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:06,500
Have you had seasons when the harvest
was poor due to weather conditions?

25
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:11,000
How did this reflect on
oil production volume and cost?

26
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:16,500
Basically, once every two years
there is either a drought or some frosts.

27
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:22,000
We try our maximum locally,
if not, we take products from the region,

28
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:26,000
from Romania, Ukraine, or imports.

29
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:31,500
We cannot fight the drought,
we just procure the necessary seeds

30
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:35,500
outside of local products
if what arrived on the local market is available.

31
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:41,000
How useful would the functionality
of our application and QR code system

32
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:45,500
be for your farm, especially for
confirming artisanal oil quality

33
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:48,500
and planning raw material purchases?

34
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,000
Every year it is harder
and harder to manage and lead.

35
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:58,000
For this, every year we implement
practically all technologies

36
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:02,500
that can be implemented
within the company.

37
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:07,500
We track and strive to automate
and digitize the processes

38
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:10,500
within the company.

39
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:13,000
Thank you very much!
